The world I notice because I've changed will reflect who I am now, right?

628
00:50:23,125 --> 00:50:29,425
あなたの思う未来は 何が映っているの？
In the future you envision, what is reflected?

629
00:50:30,925 --> 00:50:33,825
愛なき明日へ行くの
I'm heading towards a loveless tomorrow.

630
00:50:33,825 --> 00:50:39,725
引きとめないで 恋しくたって 私は進みたい
Don't hold me back; even if I miss you, I want to move forward.

631
00:50:39,725 --> 00:50:43,225
chAngE 止まらない 振り向かないよ
Change, I won't stop, I won't look back.

632
00:50:43,225 --> 00:50:46,525
いつだって真実求めていたいの
I want to always be seeking the truth.

633
00:50:46,525 --> 00:50:51,425
涙も愛おしく思える気がする
I feel like I can even treasure my tears.

634
00:50:51,425 --> 00:50:54,725
もう chAngE 忘れない なくしたくない
Change now, I won't forget, I don't want to lose it.

635
00:50:54,725 --> 00:51:00,125
喜びも抱きしめて 走り出すよ
Embracing even joy, I'll start running!

636
00:51:00,125 --> 00:51:05,925
あなたの元から離れてしまっても
Even if I stray far away from you,

637
00:51:05,925 --> 00:51:10,125
私は私らしく I wanna chAngE
I'll stay true to myself, I wanna change.

638
00:51:22,525 --> 00:51:28,125
私Changedが私Changedの先にあなたがいるなら
If you are there at the destination of my change,

639
00:51:28,125 --> 00:51:33,825
あなたが変わった先に私がいるなら
If I am there at the destination of your change,

640
00:51:33,825 --> 00:51:36,625
chAngE

641
00:51:36,625 --> 00:51:44,325
Ah... chAngE...

642
00:51:44,325 --> 00:51:46,425
走り出すよ
I'll start running!

643
00:51:46,425 --> 00:51:49,825
chAngE なびかない 流されないよ
Change, I won't yield, I won't be swept away.

644
00:51:49,825 --> 00:51:53,125
今感じることに行動で言いたいの
I want to be honest with what I feel right now.

645
00:51:53,125 --> 00:51:58,125
誰かの思い通りにはさせないわ
I won't let things go just as someone else wants.

646
00:51:58,125 --> 00:52:01,425
もう chAngE 何度でも生まれ変わるの
Change now, I will be reborn again and again.

647
00:52:01,425 --> 00:52:06,725
悲しみも抱きしめて 走り出すよ
Embracing even sorrow, I'll start running!

648
00:52:06,725 --> 00:52:12,725
二人で同じ景色が見れるなら
If we can see the same scenery together,

649
00:52:12,725 --> 00:52:18,525
あなたの元にいつか帰りたいわ
I want to return to you someday.

650
00:52:18,525 --> 00:52:22,625
私は私らしく I wanna chAngE
I'll stay true to myself, I wanna change.

651
00:52:45,925 --> 00:52:47,425
あのね
You know what?

652
00:52:49,125 --> 00:52:54,125
Luna say maybe

653
00:53:15,025 --> 00:53:17,025
I say "私、大丈夫?"
I say, "Am I okay?"

654
00:53:17,025 --> 00:53:18,825
Maybe, うまくやれるはず
Maybe, I should be able to do this well.

655
00:53:18,825 --> 00:53:21,925
ずっと走った 息継ぎもしないまま
Running all this time without even catching my breath...

656
00:53:21,925 --> 00:53:24,025
あっそう、終わりが来るなら
Oh right, if the end is coming,

657
00:53:24,025 --> 00:53:25,825
別に寂しくなんかはない
I'm not particularly lonely or anything.

658
00:53:25,825 --> 00:53:28,225
真実は心の奥の方
The truth lies deep inside my heart.

659
00:53:28,225 --> 00:53:30,525
自分のことすら愛せないまま
Without even being able to love myself,

660
00:53:30,525 --> 00:53:36,125
君のこと守れるのかな
I wonder if I can protect you...

661
00:53:36,825 --> 00:53:40,525
どうか、正真正銘のこの思いを
Please, hear this genuine feeling of mine,

662
00:53:40,525 --> 00:53:44,325
聴いて 私、全身全霊で歌うから
Listen, because I'll sing with my whole heart and soul.

663
00:53:44,325 --> 00:53:47,525
大丈夫、世界はこんなに綺麗だと
It's okay, telling myself how beautiful the world is—

664
00:53:47,525 --> 00:53:50,225
分かってる、分かってる、解ってる...わかってるよ！
I know, I know, I understand... I get it!

665
00:53:50,225 --> 00:53:51,725
ごめんね。じれったい
I'm sorry. It's frustrating.

666
00:53:51,725 --> 00:53:54,525
足りない、こんなんじゃ誰も愛せないの
It's not enough; like this, I can't love anyone.

667
00:53:54,525 --> 00:53:58,125
止めない、止まることは知らないの
Don't stop me, I don't know how to stop.

668
00:53:58,125 --> 00:54:03,525
言葉足らず、なくしてしまうものばかりだ
Short on words, losing things is all I ever do.

669
00:54:03,525 --> 00:54:07,025
Luna say maybe...

670
00:54:07,025 --> 00:54:10,825
くるのは
What comes is...

671
00:54:10,825 --> 00:54:14,325
迷be, rainy...
Maybe, rainy...

672
00:54:18,325 --> 00:54:20,225
I say どんな自分でも
I say, no matter what kind of person I am,

673
00:54:20,225 --> 00:54:22,125
Navy色に染まるまで
Until I'm dyed in navy blue,

674
00:54:22,125 --> 00:54:25,125
時間はかかるかもしれないけど
It might take some time, but...

675
00:54:25,125 --> 00:54:27,325
I know, 輝くしかないこと
I know, the only choice is to shine.

676
00:54:27,325 --> 00:54:30,125
ハイライト、塗り続けるしかない
I just have to keep painting over the highlights.

677
00:54:30,125 --> 00:54:32,825
真実はちゃんと、言わなくちゃね
I really have to speak the truth properly, right?

678
00:54:32,825 --> 00:54:36,825
目に見えるものが続くと
Hoping that the things visible to the eye...

679
00:54:36,825 --> 00:54:41,325
ずっと
will last forever,

680
00:54:41,325 --> 00:54:45,425
そう、ずっと
Yes, forever...

681
00:54:45,425 --> 00:54:47,625
想いたい
I want to hold onto it.

682
00:55:05,113 --> 00:55:06,313
